[I] A C implementation of the ITU G729 Annex A/B codec

[T] Bcg729 is an open source implementation of both encoder and decoder of
[T] the ITU G.729 Annex A/B speech codec by Belledonne Communications. The
[T] portable C99 library runs on ARM and x86 and supports concurrent channel
[T] encoding and decoding for multi-call applications such as conferencing.

[U] https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/bcg729

[A] Bcg729 Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

